Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 03:03:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Show live scores on the web feed viewer

Proxy POST /api/scores/resolve to the PlexFlix scores sidecar (SCORES_URL),
then paint matched score lines on game cards. Soft-fails when scores are unset
or unreachable so browsing/playback stay unchanged.
